    "title": "WVAA holds second annual Media Day at Red Barn - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Grant Pugh ,\n1 hours ago\nTERRE HAUTE, Ind. (WTWO/WAWV) — The Wabash Valley Athletic Association hosted their second annual Boys High School Basketball Media Day at the Red Barn.\n33 different teams took place in the event as we all prepare for a brand new season.\nThe first day of practice in Indiana happens next week.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to MyWabashValley.com.",
